    "done_when": "Root cause (run r-20261002T221031289251, merged 8dcd60bd5, benchmarks/picard_derivative_contract.py): fixed_point.picard returns a jax.lax.fori_loop (nova/equilibrium/fixed_point.py:2918-2942) with no derivative rule, so reverse mode and the JVP differentiate the 80 relaxed updates. The explicit terminal tangent (I - dG/dpsi)x = dG/dtheta v brings the plasma-current derivative to 0.0045 of central differences, against 11.31 unrolled. Three locked decisions require implicit differentiation of converged solves, never differentiation through the loop: flux-function-forward-transport loop-differentiability and gradient-scope, and separatrix-spline-extraction polish-termination. Contract: (1) the implicit rule applies only at a converged fixed point; a non-converged picard state yields a flagged or refused derivative (for example NaN tangents beside the converged flag), never a silent implicit tangent; (2) topology masks and partitions are frozen at the terminal state, consistent with the locked live-warmup-frozen-newton decision; (3) the adjoint is a forward linear solve inside the derivative rule, on the transpose obtained from jax.vjp of the map at the frozen terminal state, and never reverse-differentiates _qualified_krylov_step; the custom_vmap reverse-mode guard in followup f-fsri-krylov-slice-2-review-findings lands after this node and takes this rule as its positive case; (4) both reverse mode and jax.jvp return the implicit tangent (a custom_linear_solve or custom_root formulation gives both). Gate: (a) a new tests/test_picard_implicit_derivative.py asserts, on a converged small fixture, that reverse, JVP and the implicit tangent agree to 1e-10 and match central differences within a bound stated with its step, that a non-converged state is flagged or refused, and that the no-selection scalar control agrees to 1e-10; it fails at the dispatch base. (b) benchmarks/picard_derivative_contract.py re-run at this node's committed revision, with a SHA-256 of the driver source printed in the receipt, shows reverse equal to the implicit tangent with the plasma-current error near 0.0045. (c) The three tests test_the_solve_is_differentiable_in_the_conductor_current, test_the_plasma_current_is_differentiable_in_the_conductor_current and test_the_moment_map_is_differentiable_against_finite_differences in tests/test_equilibrium_forward_solve.py are run with their values reported. Do not widen any tolerance; where one still fails, state why, citing the RCA's linked-flux nonsmooth residue (0.53) or the finite-difference step. (d) tests/test_equilibrium_forward_solve.py and tests/test_fixed_point.py add no failure against the dispatch base. Re-render the derivative-estimates figure into this node's figures directory with uncropped axis labels, per the data-ink plot rules. Run GPU and long gates through RECKON_ALLOW_NESTED_LAUNCH=1 scripts/nova_lane/run.sh --rungs h200 --force-submit; the coordinator authorises this launch path, and the general fence does not forbid it. For a base-revision tree, use git archive extracted under /tmp with PYTHONPATH pointing there, because .git/worktrees is read-only in this fence. Every uv command carries --no-sync and nothing runs uv sync. Write the manifest before any long step; its status is one of complete, blocked or failed.",
